{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24173","headline":"蓝田刘明府携酌相过与皇甫郎中卯时同饮醉後赠之 · 白居易","name":"蓝田刘明府携酌相过与皇甫郎中卯时同饮醉後赠之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腊月九日煖寒客，卯时十分空腹杯。\n玄晏舞狂乌帽落，蓝田醉倒玉山颓。\n貌偷花色老蹔去，歌蹋柳枝春闇来。\n不爲刘家贤圣物，愁翁笑口大难开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}